# A nest of 4000 additions on a u8, in a position with no declared type, is
# checked in time near linear in its depth. Each addition holds a bare literal
# as its left operand, and the next one as its right operand. Each literal takes
# the type u8 from its sibling, so the innermost literal is out of range for u8.
